      "title": "Python — 10 Functions",
      "topic": "Programming — Python",
      "description": "Defining and calling functions, arguments, default arguments, and returning one value or several. Six Parsons problems and an MCQ. The distinction that does the most work here is between printing a value and handing it back.",
